        <mxCell id="47" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;endSize=8;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#C62828;fontColor=#C62828;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="21b. [Domain Guard] PATCH /status { FINALIZED } bloqueado ➔ HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1255" y="1506" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="165" y="1506" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="48" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;fontColor=#6A1B9A;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="21c. POST /service-orders/{id}/extra-executions/approve { approved: true|false, notes } (via API GW)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="165" y="1548" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1255" y="1548" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="49" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#C62828;fontColor=#C62828;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="21d. [false] EXTRA_EXEC#=REFUSED ➔ REFUSED_EXTRA_TASKS ➔ IN_EXECUTION (mantém preço)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1290" y="1612" /><mxPoint x="1290" y="1638" /></Array><mxPoint x="1255" y="1612" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1260" y="1638" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="50" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1B5E20;fontColor=#1B5E20;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="21e. [true] EXTRA_EXEC#=APPROVED ➔ APPROVAL_EXTRA_TASKS ➔ IN_EXECUTION (+EXEC#, recalc R$)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1290" y="1684" /><mxPoint x="1290" y="1710" /></Array><mxPoint x="1255" y="1684" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1260" y="1710" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="51" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#00695C;fontColor=#00695C;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="22. POST /execute_task/{execId}?serviceOrderId={id}&amp;status=FINALIZED (todas execuções)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="165" y="1774" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1255" y="1774" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="52" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#004D40;fontColor=#004D40;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="23. order.checkCompletion(): todas EXEC#==FINALIZED ➔ Auto-transição OS para FINALIZED + endTime"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1290" y="1806" /><mxPoint x="1290" y="1832" /></Array><mxPoint x="1255" y="1806" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1260" y="1832" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="53" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#EF6C00;fontColor=#EF6C00;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="24a. schedulerOsReadyForPayment() [GSI pending-dispatch] ➔ os-ready-for-payment-queue"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1255" y="1950" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1535" y="1950" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="54" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1565C0;fontColor=#1565C0;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="24b. PaymentSqsConsumer (ou POST /payment/{orderId}) ➔ Cria cobrança Mercado Pago (Circuit Breaker)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1535" y="1988" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="2075" y="1988" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="55" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#EF6C00;fontColor=#EF6C00;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="25. Grava tb-payment (PAY# PENDING + INV#) e publica SQS payment-notification-queue"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2075" y="2028" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1535" y="2028" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="56" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#C2185B;fontColor=#C2185B;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="26. NotificationSqsConsumer consome pagamento ➔ Envia cobrança / link PIX ao cliente"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1535" y="2066" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1805" y="2066" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="57" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1565C0;fontColor=#1565C0;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="27. POST /payment/{paymentId}/confirm (ou Webhook /payment/webhook) ➔ PAY# APPROVED em tb-payment"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="165" y="2106" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="2075" y="2106" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="58" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#EF6C00;fontColor=#EF6C00;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="28. Publica PaymentSuccess em payment-success-queue + recibo em payment-notification-queue"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2075" y="2144" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1535" y="2144" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="59" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#00695C;fontColor=#00695C;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="29. pollPaymentSuccess() consome fila ➔ Atualiza OS para status = PAID + HIST# (Saga Concluída)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1535" y="2180" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1255" y="2180" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="60" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#C62828;fontColor=#C62828;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="30a. POST /payment/{id}/refund (ou /order/{orderId}/refund) ➔ Estorno REFUNDED em tb-payment"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="165" y="2258" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="2075" y="2258" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="61" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;endSize=8;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#C62828;fontColor=#C62828;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="30b. Publica evento payment_refunded na SQS payment-notification-queue"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2075" y="2292" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1535" y="2292" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="62" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;endSize=8;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#512DA8;fontColor=#512DA8;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.3;" value="31. [Async Contínuo] OTel Agent &amp; Propagação W3C traceparent ➔ Spans (Jaeger), Métricas (Prometheus) e Logs (Loki)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1255" y="2372" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="2340" y="2372" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="63" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;📐 DIRETRIZES ARQUITETURAIS DA FASE 4 (SAGA COREOGRAFADA, SINGLE-TABLE DYNAMODB, RESILIÊNCIA &amp;amp; OBSERVABILIDADE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Decomposição em 4 Microsserviços (Database per Service):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;register-service&lt;/code&gt; (PostgreSQL RDS + Redis), &lt;code&gt;service-order-execution-service&lt;/code&gt; (DynamoDB &lt;code&gt;tb-service_order&lt;/code&gt; Single-Table), &lt;code&gt;payment-service&lt;/code&gt; (DynamoDB &lt;code&gt;tb-payment&lt;/code&gt; + Mercado Pago Circuit Breaker) e &lt;code&gt;notification-service&lt;/code&gt; (e-mail/portal). Nenhum serviço acessa a base de dados do outro.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Saga Coreografada &amp;amp; Rollbacks (AWS SQS + DLQs):&lt;/b&gt; Comunicação assíncrona via 5 filas principais + 5 DLQs (&lt;code&gt;maxReceiveCount=3&lt;/code&gt;) com compensação para recusa de orçamento (&lt;code&gt;REFUSED&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;CANCELED&lt;/code&gt;) e estorno financeiro (&lt;code&gt;POST /payment/{id}/refund&lt;/code&gt; ➔ &lt;code&gt;REFUNDED&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Máquina de Estados Intermediária de Execuções Extras:&lt;/b&gt; Inclusão de tarefas adicionais move a OS para &lt;code&gt;WAITING_APPROVAL_EXTRA_TASKS&lt;/code&gt; com bloqueio Domain Guard &lt;code&gt;422&lt;/code&gt; contra finalização prematura, transitando via &lt;code&gt;APPROVAL_EXTRA_TASKS&lt;/code&gt; (integra &lt;code&gt;EXEC#&lt;/code&gt; e recalcula &lt;code&gt;totalPrice&lt;/code&gt;) ou &lt;code&gt;REFUSED_EXTRA_TASKS&lt;/code&gt; (mantém preço) antes de retornar a &lt;code&gt;IN_EXECUTION&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Observabilidade &amp;amp; Auto-Cura (PF-10 / PF-11):&lt;/b&gt; Propagação W3C &lt;code&gt;traceparent&lt;/code&gt; em headers HTTP e atributos SQS conectando os traces no Jaeger/Grafana, aliada a probes de liveness monitorando listeners SQS (&lt;code&gt;SqsListenerHealthIndicator&lt;/code&gt;)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="175" width="2420" x="40" y="2495" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
